    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoswa okhukalusibwa mushilenje shiaMusa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Musa natsia naboolela Isiraeli yosi amakhuwa ako; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nabasunjila ari Isie bulaano endi owemiyika eshikhumi namakhumi kabili; shishinyala okhusamulanga nokhuchelela ta; khandi OMWAMI yamboolela mbu Shiolaambukha Yorodani kuno ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI Nyasayewo niye oularanjilila okhwambukha imbeliwo; alamalilana amahanga ako imleliwo, nawe Olaka-bukula; naye Yoswa alaranjilila okhwambukha imbeliwo, shinga OMWAMI olwa yaboola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI alakholela bo shinga olwa yakholela Sihoni nende Ogu, abaruchi babaAmori, nende eshialo shiabwe, olwa yabamalilana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI alabahaana mumakhono keenywe, neenyu mula bakholela muri nanwa, lilako liosi elia emulachil shinga olwa lili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiiinyie, wume ikholoj orz ria kata okhubatechelela ta; okhuba OMWAMI Nyasayewo niye outsia ninawe; shialakhwibal kata okhukhulekha tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Musa namulanga Yoswa, namusunjila, abaIsiraeli bosi nibalola, ari Witinyie, wume ilkholo; okhuba olatsia nabandu bano okhwinjila mushialo eshia OMWAMI yeetsubila abakuuka babwe okhubaheelesia; nawe olachila nibashilia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye OMWAMI niye ouranjilila okhutsia imbe-liwo; alabeetsanga ninawe halala; shialakhwibala kata okhukhulekha ta; oraria kata okhufwa omwoyo tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amalako okhusoomugwa buli khumiyika musaafu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Musa yahandiika amalako kano, nakaheelesia abakuhani abaana baLawi, abachinganga lisanduku lieindakano yOMWAMI, nende khubakofu bosi baIsiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi Musa nabalaka ari Buli olwa emiyika chiba nichihweele musaafu, khunduukho yomuyika kwobulekhuuli, khwisabo liamatili, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "olwa Isiraeli yosi yiba niyitsile okhulolekha imbeli wOMWAMI Nyasayewo habundu tsana aha alalobola, osoomenje amalako kano imbeli waIsiraeli yosi, nibahulila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhung'aasinjie abadu, mbu abasaatsa nabakhasi nabaana abatiiti, nabarende ababa nibali mumataalako, mbu bahulile, nibeeka, nibaria OMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe, nibeetsulila okhukhola amakhuwa kosi kamalako kano; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khandi mbu abaana babwe, abarashiamanya ta, bahulile, nibeeka okhuria OMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe, tsindaalo tsiosi olwa mushimenya mushialo eshio eshia mulaambukha Yorodani nimutsia okhushibukula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ameebaalo kOMWAMI khuMusa akahelelesia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI naboolela Musa ari Lola, tsindaalotsio tsiulanga olwa okhoyile okhufwa. Langa Yoswa, musinjile imbeli wanje mwiheema liokhwakaana, mbu emulachilisie. Nabo Musa naYoswa nibatsia, nibasinjila imbeli w mwiheema liokhwakaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana OMWAMI naloleshela mwiheema, mwileesi eliingana isiilo; lileesi elo lieisiilo nilisinjila hamuliango kweliheema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI namusunjila Musa ari Lola, olakona nolonda khubakuukabo; ne abandu bano balabuukha, nibalonda abanyasaye abacheni beshialo eshio shinga abaheyi, yaho ewa batsia okhuba hakari wabwe, nibandekha isie, niboo-noonia indakano yanje eya ndalakana ninabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana oburima bwanje bulabaashila khunya-nga eyo; ndalabalekha, nimbabisila tsimoni tsianje; nabo balaliibwa kutu, khandi amabii amanji namasila amanji kalabeetsela, okhuula olwa baboola khunyanga eyo bari Ne amabii kano shikakhwitsiile shichila Nyasaye weefwe shiali hakari weefwe ta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasi okhubisa ndalabisa tsimoni tsianje khunyanga eyo khulwa obubii bwosi obwa balaba nibakholile, olwa baba nibashiukhaane nibatsiile khubanyasaye bandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako muhandiiche olwimbo luno, nimubeechesia abaana baIsiraeli; mulure muminwa chiabwe, mbu olwimbo luno lundumbulile obuloli okhuyinga abaana baIsiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba olwa ndalaba nimbeenjisiye mushialo eshia ndeetsubila abakuuka babwe okhubaheelesia, eshiitsuulemwo amabeele nobuushi; nabo olwa balaba nibaliile nibeekuure, nibakhomeele; habwenaho balashiukhana nibatsia khubanyasaye bandi, nibabakhalabanila, nibandeka isie, niboonoonia indakano yanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa amabii amanji namasila amanji kalaba nikabeetseele, kho olwimbo luno lularumbula imbeli wabwe akobuloli; okhuba shiluleebililwa muminwa chiabaana babwe ta; okhuba emanyile tsiyemi etsia bakasinjia kata bulaano, nishili okhubeenjisia mushialo eshia ndeetsuba okhubaheelesia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Musa yahandiika olwimbo luno khunyanga yeneyo, nalwechesia abaana baIsiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne OMWAMI yalachilisia Yoswa waNuni, ari Witinyie, wume ikholo; okhuba oleenjisia abaana baIsiraeli mushialo eshia ndeetsuba okhubaheelesia; nasi ndalabeetsanga ninawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa Musa yali namalile okhuhandiika amakhuwa kamalako kano mushitabu, okhuula olwa kali nikahweele, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yalaka abaLawi, abachinganga lisanduku lieindakano yOMWAMI, ari ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukule eshitabu shino shiamalako, nimushira halubafu Iwelisanduku lieindakano yOMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe, shibeetsenjeho nishirumbula akobuloli okhumufukula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
