          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba emanyile induliyo shinga olwa yili, nobutinyu bwelikosilio; lole, kata olwa eshiliho mwoyo nineenywe leelo, mwakholelanga OMWAMI induli; ne shimulashila okhukhola inyuma wokhufwa khwanje? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhung'aasilie abakofu bosi betsimbia tsieenywe, nabasinjilili beenywe, mbu emboole amakhuwa kano nibahulila, ninanga likulu neshialo okhubafukula nobuloli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba emanyile mbu inyuma wokhufwa khwanje muleeyoonoonilia elala, nimwibera okhurula khunjila eya ndamulaka; ne obubii bulamukwila mundaalo tsiolunyuma, shichila mulakholanga akali amabii mumoni tsiOMWAMI, nimumusinyisia nebikhole biamakhono keenywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
